===Media===

Inserts a wiki image into the map at a specific point by supplying the filename with [[#arg-media-img|<code>img</code>]]. Images are rendered at native size by default, which can be overriden with a custom [[#arg-media-size|<code>size</code>]] in pixels.

For cases where images lack visiblity, an outline can be supplied with [[#arg-media-outlineColour|<code>outlineColour</code>]], [[#arg-media-outlineSize|<code>outlineSize</code>]] and [[#arg-media-outlineBlur|<code>outlineBlur</code>]].

