[[#arg-feat-offsetX|<code>offsetX</code>]], [[#arg-feat-offsetY|<code>offsetY</code>]] — Shifts rstext and media away from the placed centre point. Positive values correspond to rightward/downward shift.

[[#arg-feat-rotate|<code>rotate</code>]] — Rotates rstext and media. Positive values correspond to clockwise rotation. Units can be <code>deg</code>, <code>rad</code> or <code>turn</code>.

